{"title": "Kawhi Leonard signs two-year, $115 million extension with Raptors", "summary": "Kawhi Leonard has signed a two-year contract extension worth US$115 million with the Toronto Raptors, according to multiple media reports. The deal is an extension on his recently reacquired status with the team.", "summary_points": [], "title_hi": "कावी लियोनार्ड ने रैप्टर्स के साथ दो साल, 115 मिलियन डॉलर का विस्तार किया", "summary_hi": "कई मीडिया रिपोर्टों के अनुसार, कावी लियोनार्ड ने टोरंटो रैप्टर्स के साथ दो साल का अनुबंध विस्तार किया है, जो 115 मिलियन अमेरिकी डॉलर का है। यह सौदा टीम के साथ उनकी हाल ही में पुनः प्राप्त स्थिति का विस्तार है।", "summary_points_hi": [], "framing": {"center": ["Reporting focused on the concrete details of the contract extension: the two-year term and the US$115 million value."]}, "framing_hi": {"center": ["रिपोर्टिंग अनुबंध विस्तार के ठोस विवरणों पर केंद्रित थी: दो साल की अवधि और 115 मिलियन अमेरिकी डॉलर का मूल्य।"]}, "topic": "Sports", "region": "World", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://globalnews.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/7d841aa227aa8e57a2f485bb548febd1f838af18b4a477815b2ec3f5a332caef.jpg?quality=65&strip=all", "sources": [{"source": "Global News (Canada)", "owner": "Global News (Canada)", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxPQjlRNnJkXzdNTWdMUUwyWlJPdzl3VXBEN2hZM0tDMXczUGF4R01USVJzbDA3Q2pXeDBnd0pXNmZmM1loOGJKam5TS1pKYkg0VXQwRGdUcVljWWhIMHFnZlpzTW5GWGdydFB2cGdZMFZuellOTUlfUFRCSWZ3U2QySVR2YWducE9OYVI5QmV3?oc=5", "headline": "Jaden Bradley signs multi-year deal with Raptors"}, {"source": "CBC News", "owner": "CBC News", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPQllTZXJZenY2SG13c050QmRpZC1qM0d4N3FoZ0EzbmJKNjM4VjFPOXNVN1JiQ0FuVDh6dGxJMGxxT3NGMWc5T0VJUkdkX3pDMFNTX0I5SGZ5dG5GakVnZG1uUWNuWWc3WjdoWGNTNnFIV20ydEFER092SmZyMmIxdEJHakdBU2NBY1dTSXdseHNQdW9K?oc=5", "headline": "Leonard signs 2-year, $115-million US extension wit